The even-overlap tie rule and sparse pair-XOR rows follow the independent
DistQLDPC implementations in GH-162 and GH-181. The underlying ideas
were inspired by Qubitserf, revision 04b9349, by Serban Cercelescu and
the Qubitserf contributors (MIT). This directory contains original C and
Coq implementations. See the repository NOTICE, MODIFICATIONS.md and LICENSE.
